<questions><question-record><question>&amp;#x00BF;Qu&amp;#x00E9; caracter&amp;#x00ED;stica tuvo hist&amp;#x00F3;ricamente la red de transportes de Argentina?</question><clue></clue><category></category><weighting>100</weighting><fixed>0</fixed><question-type>1</question-type><answers><answer><text>Una distribuci&amp;#x00F3;n uniforme en todo el territorio.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Una organizaci&amp;#x00F3;n radial que converg&amp;#x00ED;a en Buenos Aires.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Una concentraci&amp;#x00F3;n exclusiva en la Patagonia.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Una organizaci&amp;#x00F3;n centrada solamente en el transporte fluvial.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer></answers></question-record><question-record><question>&amp;#x00BF;Cu&amp;#x00E1;l es uno de los principales medios de transporte terrestre de cargas en Argentina, seg&amp;#x00FA;n el cap&amp;#x00ED;tulo?</question><clue></clue><category></category><weighting>100</weighting><fixed>0</fixed><question-type>1</question-type><answers><answer><text>El subterr&amp;#x00E1;neo.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>La bicicleta.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>El cami&amp;#x00F3;n.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>El tranv&amp;#x00ED;a.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer></answers></question-record><question-record><question>&amp;#x00BF;C&amp;#x00F3;mo se llamaba la primera locomotora del servicio ferroviario argentino mencionado en el texto?</question><clue></clue><category></category><weighting>100</weighting><fixed>0</fixed><question-type>2</question-type><answers><answer><text>La Porte&amp;#x00F1;a</text><feedback></feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer></answers></question-record><question-record><question>&amp;#x00BF;Qu&amp;#x00E9; empresa estatal de comunicaciones fue privatizada en 1990?</question><clue></clue><category></category><weighting>100</weighting><fixed>0</fixed><question-type>2</question-type><answers><answer><text>ENTEL</text><feedback></feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text></text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text></text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text></text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer></answers></question-record><question-record><question>&amp;#x00BF;Qu&amp;#x00E9; es el transporte multimodal?</question><clue></clue><category></category><weighting>100</weighting><fixed>0</fixed><question-type>3</question-type><answers><answer><text>El uso exclusivo del transporte ferroviario.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>0</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>La combinaci&amp;#x00F3;n de distintos medios de transporte en una misma operaci&amp;#x00F3;n.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>El transporte exclusivo de pasajeros.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>0</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>El traslado de mercanc&amp;#x00ED;as solamente por barcos.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>0</include-in-mc-options></answer></answers></question-record><question-record><question>&amp;#x00BF;Qu&amp;#x00E9; funci&amp;#x00F3;n cumple el subterr&amp;#x00E1;neo en Buenos Aires?</question><clue></clue><category></category><weighting>100</weighting><fixed>0</fixed><question-type>3</question-type><answers><answer><text>Transportar mercanc&amp;#x00ED;as entre pa&amp;#x00ED;ses.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>0</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Conectar exclusivamente puertos mar&amp;#x00ED;timos.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>0</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Facilitar el transporte de pasajeros dentro de la ciudad.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Reemplazar el transporte ferroviario de cargas.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>0</include-in-mc-options></answer></answers></question-record><question-record><question>&amp;#x00BF;Cu&amp;#x00E1;les de los siguientes son r&amp;#x00ED;os importantes para el transporte fluvial argentino mencionados en el cap&amp;#x00ED;tulo?</question><clue></clue><category></category><weighting>100</weighting><fixed>0</fixed><question-type>4</question-type><answers><answer><text>R&amp;#x00ED;o Paran&amp;#x00E1;.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>R&amp;#x00ED;o Paraguay.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>R&amp;#x00ED;o Nilo.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>R&amp;#x00ED;o Amazonas.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer></answers><must-select-all>1</must-select-all></question-record><question-record><question>&amp;#x00BF;Cu&amp;#x00E1;les de los siguientes son ejemplos de tecnolog&amp;#x00ED;as o servicios de comunicaci&amp;#x00F3;n mencionados en el cap&amp;#x00ED;tulo?</question><clue></clue><category></category><weighting>100</weighting><fixed>0</fixed><question-type>4</question-type><answers><answer><text>Internet.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Telefon&amp;#x00ED;a m&amp;#x00F3;vil.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Arado tradicional.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Locomotora a vapor.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer></answers><must-select-all>1</must-select-all></question-record></questions>
